", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982683_881434080827086_5377137216687803039_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qa8AZmcTGZYQ7kNvwHhnAN7&_nc_oc=AdkzsNTjWRfR17gTtTRGwmuLoeulLXQPTnrJ6RGQoIrx5KHBoVbTT3h6ZTwrGJp-fGI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftNAXFdInbPHKgKqLAmvGQyRQTguqfpITzll1cPK82KGw&oe=69A833B5"}, {"file_name": "26ca59a0714a4b168595559b45b758d9_resized.png", "id": "480955591228899", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031309_480955594562232_1744480508559689506_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Op_MSpr68eAQ7kNvwHXkTqU&_nc_oc=Adm_KqmEd2FRCJL7kpI49hJhvMJogbH1H7R6GgsqusGn1qUng6PGR4d7ppggGXPMPKA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfskZSo85LpjBfe87OgPjIorYH9R1dGg21th2bjSmr9f_g&oe=69A809CD"}, {"file_name": "6ee8aed9fcdf458a9db7a93553a03839_resized.png", "id": "935111128714060", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974856_935111132047393_4875139789889162814_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cajMK8AVYCgQ7kNvwH2hqu6&_nc_oc=AdkOTbKTxkZH_mvOftU41enCUqwYovIuQYNwV5wk5-Bk67U8FtgiCDKK4losZayFHnI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afv4teW3QkFbp9OqRbvQy2D13iO2jGqbShHHvHEyD76DoQ&oe=69A80A49"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Volleyball VR (Early Access)", "keywords": ["volleyball", "beach", "sports", "sandbox", "fitness"], "long_description": "\u2795 Simulation Physics: Feel the most realistic volleyball gameplay in VR. Control serves, spikes, and volleys with precision like never before.\n\ud83c\udfae Multiplayer Games: Jump into 99 players sandbox lobbies, 2v2, 4v4, and full beach tournaments with friends, AI, or other players from around the world.\n\n\ud83c\udf0d Massive Social Courts: Connect with others and explore vibrant beach environments while soaking in the Miami vibes.\n\ud83c\udfa8 Endless Styles: Unlock cosmetics\u2014jerseys, shorts, sunglasses, hats, team logos, and more to express your unique beachside flair.\n\nUpgrade with the Miami Courts Bundle for:\n\ud83c\udf1f Exclusive Courts: Play on beautifully designed courts inspired by Miami\u2019s famous beach culture.\n\ud83c\udfc6 Team Apparel & Challenges: Unlock branded jerseys, volleyballs, and hats. Complete challenges to earn additional gear.\n\ud83c\udfa8 Premium Cosmetics: Access exclusive volleyball-themed outfits, gear, and accessories to stand out on the court.\n\nFuture Roadmap:\nVolleyball VR PRO unlocks:\n\ud83c\udfe0 Private Matches: Create custom spaces and rules for exclusive games with friends.\n\ud83c\udfad Full-Body Avatars: Personalize your look with hairstyle, body shape, height, tattoos, and more.\n\ud83c\udfa8 Exclusive Gear: Mascot outfits, summer styles, retro shades, and more premium cosmetics.", "short_description": "Volleyball VR is the ultimate virtual reality volleyball and sports experience \ud83c\udfd0\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\n\nStep onto Miami\u2019s iconic beaches and dive into thrilling 99-player lobbies across 14 volleyball courts. Whether you're a casual player or a fierce competitor, Volleyball VR offers the perfect blend of realism, fun, and community.\n\nDownload Volleyball VR FREE to experience:\n\u2795 Simulation Physics: Feel the most realistic volleyball gameplay in VR. Control serves, spikes, and volleys with precision like never b4"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mdrngames.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MDRNgames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mdrngames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_